Current +1 greatsword, 19-20/x2.

- normal full attack: **+17/+12, 2d6+13 +1d6 precision**;
- Power Attack ON: **+15/+10, 2d6+19 +1d6 precision**;
- Minute Hand with PA: **+13, 2d6+19 +1d6 precision**.

The +1d6 Inner Eye damage is precision damage and is not multiplied on a critical.

### Emergency Caged Sun profile

With The Caged Sun and 2 Essence instead of Inner Eye:

- AC **24**, touch **18** (mithral shirt Max DEX +6);
- CMB **+12**, CMD **28** under the accepted campaign Caged-Sun propagation;
- Fort +10, Ref +14, Will +13;
- normal +17/+12, **2d6+11**;
- PA +15/+10, **2d6+17**;
- received healing: **floor((incoming + 4) x 1.5)**;
- 50% HP threshold for free stance entry: **27 HP or fewer**.

- full BAB progression;
- cumulative AB save progression is Fort +1 / Ref +1 / Will +2;
- Situational Awareness remains +1 insight initiative at AB3;
- gains **Uncanny Dodge**;
- existing Psion manifesting advances by one level;
- gains **+1 maneuver readied**;
- no new maneuver known from AB3.

**Initiator Level:** **11**  
**Initiation modifier:** **CHA +7**  
**Essence pool:** **4**  
**Essence capacity:** **2**  
**Close range:** **50 ft**  
**Recovery:** full-round action

Known maneuvers remain:

- Bolster.
- Staunching Strike.
- Witness to Glory.
- Decree of Torment.
- Disrupt Essence.

Standard readied:

1. **Witness to Glory**.
2. **Disrupt Essence**.
3. **Decree of Torment**.

Known stances:

- Spoils of War.
- Armaments of the Empire.

Standard martial stance: **Armaments of the Empire**.

Standard Essence before initiative:

- **2 Witness to Glory**;
- **2 Disrupt Essence**;
- **0 Armaments of the Empire**.

### Sun's Gleam

For a qualifying Radiant Dawn strike:

- ranged touch **+8** (BAB6 + DEX2; not CHA);
- range **50 ft**;
- damage **1d6+7 force**.

Sun's Gleam is a Radiant Dawn associated weapon for the campaign's discipline-weapon save-DC interaction.

### Witness to Glory

Radiant Dawn 2 counter.

- immediate on initiative after raw rolls, usable while flat-footed;
- 0 Essence: **+7 initiative, 11 temp HP**;
- 1 Essence: **+8 initiative, 13 temp HP**;
- **2 Essence: +9 initiative, 15 temp HP**;
- standing target Styke whenever legal unless player overrides;
- expends Witness and binds invested Essence until recovery;
- consumes Vesper's upcoming swift action;
- temporary HP last **11 minutes** or until consumed; do not refill them on later turns.

### Disrupt Essence

Radiant Dawn 3 strike.

- standard; one melee/ranged attack; Sun's Gleam may supply the ranged attack;
- on hit, normal attack damage plus Will save against suppression; success negates suppression;
- choose a legitimately known **Ex/Su ability requiring an activation action**, a special sense or a special movement type. No blanket shutdown of spellcasting, passive defenses or an arbitrary class;
- base save DC **22** before Essence/associated-weapon adjustments;
- each invested Essence adds +1 DC and +1 round;
- each full 2 Essence allows one additional qualifying ability to be suppressed.

**Standard 2-Essence Disrupt:**

- suppress **two** qualifying known abilities;
- duration **9 rounds** on failed save;
- Will **DC 24** with a non-associated weapon;
- with Sun's Gleam, campaign associated-weapon +2 applies: **Will DC 26**.

### Decree of Torment

Radiant Dawn 2 strike.

- standard; one melee/ranged attack; Sun's Gleam allowed;
- hit deals normal attack damage and places **7 brands** at IM +7, lasting **1 minute** or until consumed;
- each attacking creature may consume at most one brand/round as part of an attack to attempt one combat maneuver against the branded target;
- triggering attack need not hit;
- maneuver does not provoke; ranged attackers cannot choose grapple or move with the target;
- invested Essence, if actually allocated, reduces target CMD by1/point for7rounds;
- use Vesper **IL 11** instead of BAB and **IM +7** instead of STR if better.

### Bolster

Radiant Dawn 1 counter.

- immediate when an ally within 50 ft is hit;
- **DR 7/-** for 1 round, including the triggering hit;
- +1 DR per invested Essence.

### Staunching Strike

Radiant Dawn 1 strike.

- standard melee/ranged attack; Sun's Gleam allowed;
- hit: normal attack damage then total **7 HP** healing divided among Vesper/allies within 50 ft;
- +3 total healing per invested Essence.

### Armaments of the Empire - IL 10 breakpoint (current IL 11)

Radiant Dawn 3 stance.

- empower up to **6** qualifying weapons/natural weapons within **50 ft** under the retained campaign packet;
- choose recipients on stance entry; change the selected weapons as a swift action or with a legal Essence reallocation, not an automatic new selection at every hit;
- at IL 10 each empowered weapon receives **exactly one weapon special ability** costing **up to +2 equivalent**, never two separate +1 abilities;
- different weapons may receive different legal single properties;
- no Essence is required for the weapon property;
- each Essence invested in the stance grants wielders of empowered weapons +1 CMD per point;
- standard investment remains 0.

**New level-8 defaults:**

- Styke greatsword → **Collision (+2)**.
- Valeria greatsword → **Conductive (+1)** as her default, including ordinary combat; do not switch away without a tactical reason/accepted choice.
- **Keen (+1)** on Valeria comes from her own **Fiendish Boon**, never from a second Armaments property; her remaining +1 Boon budget may also grant **Flaming (+1)** when legal.
- Once actually obtained, Valeria's permanent **Cruel** weapon property remains separate. **Greater Magic Weapon +2** may provide the enhancement bonus when Vesper actually casts it.

Conductive allows one qualifying hit per round to spend 2 Touch uses and channel one Touch of Corruption plus its selected cruelty through the weapon without consuming a separate action. It does not automatically spend those uses on every trivial enemy. Fiendish Boon is a separate **standard-action activation**, ideally before initiative, not a passive always-on spell.

### Spoils of War - healing switch stance

- close 50 ft;
- first qualifying hit by each ally each round heals that ally;
- 0 Essence **11 HP**;
- 1 Essence **13 HP**;
- 2 Essence **15 HP**;
- once per round per ally.

Retained normal feats include Extra Revelation, Improved Initiative, and Radiant Dawn Style.

Stykes Lehre remains at **Martial Training III** on character level 8; Martial Training IV is a planned level-9 progression, not granted early.

Radiant Dawn Style:

- +1 Essence remains a passive pool increase by campaign ruling;
- style entry still costs a swift action;
- once per round while the style is active, initiating a maneuver heals Vesper or one ally within close range for **8 + Essence invested in that maneuver**;
- common 2-Essence maneuver result: **10 HP**.
